meta {
  name: Unring period 1
  type: http
  seq: 40
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/bell-schedule-periods/{{bellPeriodOneId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-School-Id: {{schoolCode}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 204
}

docs {
  Bells before the schedule they hang off, and before the periods they point
  at: a bell schedule with periods still on it is refused 409, and so is a
  period that a bell still names. This is where the teardown order stops being
  cosmetic - the four deletes above cascade, these do not.
}
